# Keep the build context lean. All workspace package.json files must remain (pnpm
# frozen-lockfile validates the whole workspace graph), but node_modules, build
# artifacts, the Python engine, and web assets are not needed to run the design
# agent — its deps are installed fresh and the pi packages are built in-image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
engine
apps/web/public
**/.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
